  "verseCount": 59,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛy ti ŋuan ca ɣɔ̱n ɛn ɣöö bikɛ ŋɔaani tëë ci tuɔɔk rɛydan gɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ca tëë ca la̱t kɔ ɛ nɛy tëë ca ti̱ti̱ nɛn ni tukädɛ kɛn nɛy tëë la̱tkɛ ruac Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cä ti̱ti̱ diaal go̱r agɔaa ni tukädiɛn, ɣän cä jɛ car ɛn ɣöö bäkɛ gɔ̱a̱r ji̱ nikɛ ta̱a̱ in ci tuɔɔk kɛ kɛ lö määthdä ni Thi-ɔ-pi-läth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi thuɔ̱k ŋa̱c kɛ kui̱ ŋɔaani tin ca nyuɔ̱th ji̱.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär däpä Jɔ̱ɔ̱n in la lääk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ni̱n tëë Ɣɛ-rod ɛ kuäär kä Ju-dia, tëëkɛ bo̱o̱th palä mi cɔal i̱ Dhɛ-kar-yaa, mi la ram kɛl kä bööth palä Ä-bi-yaa. Kä ciekdɛ ɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈ Ä-ron, kä cɔalkɛ ciötdɛ i̱ I-li-dha-bɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw kɛ ji̱ cuŋni nhiam Kuɔth, cieŋkɛ ala nɛy ti thil bɛ̈l kɛ ɣöö ka̱pkɛ ŋut Kua̱r ni Kuoth diaal kɛnɛ ruaacnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö thilɛ kɛ gaat, kɛ ɣöö I-li-dha-bɛth ɛ rol, kä ci kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw dɔŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kɛl min lätdɛ la̱tdɛ ala bo̱o̱th palä rɛy luaak Kuɔth, kä te buɔ̱ndɛ lät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɛ kuany kɛ yor gaakni, kɛ ciaaŋ bo̱thä palä ɛn ɣöö bɛ wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth, kɛ ɣöö bɛ wäl in kurkur wä waŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu buɔ̱n nath kɛɛliw Kuoth pal raar, kɛ gua̱a̱th in waŋkɛ wäl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk kua̱r ni Kuoth päl kä jɛ, tëë cuŋä kui̱c cuëëc yi̱kä in la wäl a waŋkɛ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Dhɛ-kar-yaa jɛ nɛn, cuɛ wi̱cdɛ yi̱c, kä cuɛ dual ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk nhial ɛ jiök i̱, “/Cu dual, Dhɛ-kar-yaa, kɛ ɣöö ca palu liŋ. Bi ciekdu ni I-li-dha-bɛth ruët, kä bɛ dap kɛ gat mi dho̱o̱l, kä bi ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi lɔcdu tɛɛth, kä bi nɛy ti ŋuan lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth kɛ kui̱ däpädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö jɛn bɛ a ram mi di̱i̱t nhiam Kua̱r ni Kuoth. Kä thilɛ kɔaŋ mi kɛc mi bɛ math. Kä bɛ thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, /ka̱n jɛ ni dap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn bɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ti ŋuan luɔ̱c Kuäär ni Kuothdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mɛ̈l 4:5-6.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ wä nhiamdɛ kɛ yiëë kɛnɛ buɔ̱m E-li-yaa, kɛ ɣöö bɛ diëëth gan luɔc maarä kɛ gaatkiɛn. Kä bɛ nɛy tin thil luth luɔc pɛlä cuŋni, kä bɛ naath jakä ba rɔ̱ rialikä kɛ kui̱ kua̱r ni Kuoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dhɛ-kar-yaa jääk nhial jiök i̱, “Bä nɛmɛ kulɛ ŋa̱c i̱di? Kɛ ɣöö ɛ ɣän wut mi di̱i̱t, kä ci ciekdä dɔŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk nhial ɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän Gab-ri-yel. Ɣän cuɔ̱ŋä nhiam Kuɔth, kä cɛ ɣä ja̱k kɛ ɣöö bä ben ruac kɛ ji̱, nöŋä ji̱ thuk ti gɔw ti̱ti̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö /keni ruacdä min bi cop guäthdɛ cäŋ kɛl ŋäth bɛ ji̱ di̱w a /ci bi ruac, amäni cäŋ in bi ŋɔaani ti̱ti̱ tuɔɔk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn guäth ɛmɔ liip naath Dhɛ-kar-yaa. Kä cukɛ ga̱a̱c kɛ mɔ cɛ jääny luaak Kuɔth ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ ben raar, /kenɛ rɔ luäŋ kɛ ruac kɛ kɛ. Kä cukɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö cɛ nyuuth nɛn rɛy luaak Kuɔth. Cuɛ ruac kɛ tetkɛ, kä cuɛ ŋot kɛ mi /cɛ ruac luäŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ni̱n la̱tdɛ thuuk, cuɛ wä cieeŋdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ cu ciekdɛ ni I-li-dha-bɛth ruët, kä cuɛ te cieŋ kɛ päth da̱ŋ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ci Kuäär ni Kuoth ɣä lät kä mi gɔaa, kɛ ɣöö bɛ pöcdä woc rɛy nath.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär däpä Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ bäkɛl päthni cua jääk nhial ni Gab-ri-yel ja̱k ɛ Kuoth, jäkɛ jɛ rɛy ciëŋ Gɛ̈-lɛ-li mi cɔal i̱ Na-dha-rɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wëë kä nyam mi /ken met te kɛɛl kɛ wut mi ca la̱r kuën ɛ wut mi cɔal i̱ Jo-thɛp, raan thuɔk duëël Dee-bid. Kä cɔal ciöt nyam ɛmɔ i̱ Mɛri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu jääk nhial ben kä Mɛri, kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Malɛ, ji̱n nyam mi ca poth! Kuoth a kɛɛl kɛ ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Mɛri wi̱cdɛ yi̱c ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ruac ɛmɔ. Kä cuɛ ca̱r i̱ dee luɔt nërä nɔmɔ a ŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk nhial ɛ jiök i̱, “/Cu dual, Mɛri, kɛ ɣöö ci puɔ̱th jek kä Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛn ɛ, bi ruët. Kä bi dap kɛ gat mi dho̱o̱l, kä bi ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn bɛ a ram mi di̱i̱t, kä ba jɛ cɔl i̱ Gat Kuɔth Nhial in Di̱t ni jɛn. Kä bi Kuäär ni Kuoth jɛ ka̱m kɔm kuäärä gua̱ndɔɔŋdɛ ni Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ thok duëël Je-kɔb ruac amäni cäŋ kɛl, kä /ci kuäärɛ bi te kɛ pek.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛri jääk nhial jiök i̱, “Dee mɛmɛ tuɔɔk i̱di, kä ɛ ɣä nyal?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu jääk nhial jɛ jiök i̱, “Bi Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ ben kä ji̱, kä bi buɔ̱m Kuɔth in Di̱t ni jɛn ji̱ kum. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ bi gat mi in ba dap a mi rɛl rɔ, kä ba jɛ cɔl i̱ Gat Kuɔth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ, ci watdu ni I-li-dha-bɛth ruët kɛ gat mi dho̱o̱l, dɔŋädɛ. Kä ɛ jɛn pay in bäkɛliɛn kä jɛ, ɛn ram in latkɛ i̱ rol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi /ci Kuoth ɛ dee luäŋ kɛ lätni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛri wee i̱, “Ɣän ɛn, ɣän ja̱ŋ Kua̱r ni Kuoth. A jɛ tekɛ ɣä ce̱tkɛ min ci lar.” Kä cu jääk nhial jiɛɛn kä jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gui̱l Mɛri kɛ I-li-dha-bɛth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ cu Mɛri jiɛɛn, cuɛ wä Ju-dia kɛ pɛ̈th ro̱o̱l päämni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ wä dueel Dhɛ-kar-yaa, kä cuɛ I-li-dha-bɛth ner. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci I-li-dha-bɛth ner Mɛri liŋ, cu gat rɔ wany jiidɛ. Kä cu I-li-dha-bɛth thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ciöt kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱, “Ca ji̱ poth rɛy mään, kä puɔ̱th akɛ gat in te jiidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋu ci mɛ di̱i̱t ɛmɛ tuɔɔk kä ɣä mɔ, ɛn ɣöö ci man Kua̱rä ni Kuoth ben kä ɣä? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö niɛ guäth in cä neru liŋ, cu gat rɔ wany jiidä kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ca ji̱ poth kɛ ɣöö ci ŋa̱th ɛn ɣöö bi min ca la̱r ji̱ ɛ Kuäär ni Kuoth dhil tuɔɔk kä ji̱.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dit Puɔnyä Mɛri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
